{"story_id":51610,"updated_at":"2026-10-30T20:23:21","headline_en":"Mumbai openers chase 97-run target in 11 overs to beat Haryana","headline_hi":"मुंबई के ओपनर्स ने हरियाणा को हराने के लिए 11 ओवर में 97 रन के लक्ष्य का पीछा किया","payload_en":{"story_id":51610,"headline":"Mumbai openers chase 97-run target in 11 overs to beat Haryana","counts":{"articles":2,"independent_sources":1,"outlets":1},"has_established":false,"qualified_by":"express","perspective_mode":"none","perspectives":{"–":["The Hindu"]},"framing":[],"suicide":false,"thread":24335,"parents":[{"story_id":24335,"headline":"Mumbai beats Chandigarh by an innings and 155 runs at Wankhede"},{"story_id":25963,"headline":"Bengal defeats Delhi by nine wickets in Ranji Trophy match"},{"story_id":46274,"headline":"Mumbai opener Angkrish Raghuvanshi scores 114 against Haryana in Ranji Trophy"}],"children":[],"written_at":"2026-10-30T20:23:21","category":{"v":2,"primary":["india"],"secondary":["life"],"tertiary":["sport-films"]},"places":["maharashtra","haryana"],"people":["Angkrish Raghuvanshi","Divyaansh Saxena","Nishant Sindhu","Samant Jakhar","Tanush Kotian","Akash Anand","Anuj Thakral","Kanishk Chouhan"],"narrative":{"paragraphs":[[{"text":"In the morning, Tanush Kotian opened the bowling (Ranji Trophy) for Mumbai from the pavilion end.","ids":[81156],"class":"single","sources":[1]}],[{"text":"On Monday, Angkrish Raghuvanshi and Musheer Khan helped Mumbai dominate the opening day of its Ranji Trophy clash against Haryana, during which Raghuvanshi was caught behind off Samant Jakhar shortly before tea.","ids":[-71725,-71729],"class":"single","sources":[2]},{"text":"Divyaansh Saxena scored 10 runs in Mumbai's first innings.","ids":[-71739],"class":"single","sources":[2]},{"text":"Haryana bowling figures were: Aman 14-6-40-1, Ajit 15-1-44-0, Anuj Thakral 13-1-55-1, Nishant Sindhu 9-0-51-0, Jakhar 8-1-25-1, Kanishk Chouhan 20-1-59-0, Vats 3-0-11-0.","ids":[-71745],"class":"single","sources":[2]}],[{"text":"Himanshu Rana returned to bat after retiring hurt the previous evening.","ids":[81158,81174],"class":"single","sources":[1,3]},{"text":"Before the break, Akash Anand caught Sindhu off Kotian's bowling.","ids":[81160],"class":"single","sources":[1]},{"text":"Sindhu fell at the stroke of lunch by inside-edging a sweep caught by Anand.","ids":[81176],"class":"single","sources":[3]}],[{"text":"On Thursday, Kotian claimed eight wickets for 81 runs in the second innings against Haryana.","ids":[81153],"class":"single","sources":[1]},{"text":"Mumbai openers Saxena and Raghuvanshi reached the target of 97 in under 11 overs, with Raghuvanshi securing the victory by hitting a six over midwicket off Kanishk Chouhan.","ids":[81155,81178],"class":"single","sources":[1,3]},{"text":"Jakhar and Thakral put up resistance that lasted for almost two hours.","ids":[81166],"class":"single","sources":[1,3]}],[{"text":"Saxena scored 30 not out from 25 balls with two fours and two sixes.","ids":[81181],"class":"single","sources":[3]},{"text":"Raghuvanshi scored 67 not out from 39 balls with seven fours and three sixes.","ids":[81182],"class":"single","sources":[3]}],[{"text":"Mumbai needed eight wickets to bowl out Haryana and to seal victory while Haryana needed to bat out to salvage a draw.","ids":[81165,81183],"class":"single","sources":[1,3]},{"text":"Haryana scored 256 runs in 85.3 overs in the second innings.","ids":[81186],"class":"single","sources":[1,3]},{"text":"Mumbai scored 97 runs for no loss in 10.4 overs in the second innings and won the match by 10 wickets.","ids":[81187,81188],"class":"single","sources":[1,3]}]],"section_keys":["news","background","happened","performers","performers","numbers"],"sources":[{"n":1,"url":"https://www.thehindu.com/sport/cricket/ranji-trophy-kotian-fashions-mumbais-thumping-win-with-career-best-figures/article71640656.ece","outlet":"The Hindu","title":"Ranji Trophy: Kotian’s career-best show fashions Mumbai’s thumping win","perspective":"–","read":true,"readable":true},{"n":2,"url":"https://www.thehindu.com/sport/cricket/ranji-trophy-raghuvanshi-musheer-help-mumbai-take-opening-days-honours/article71626894.ece","outlet":"","title":"","perspective":"–","read":true,"readable":true},{"n":3,"url":"https://www.thehindu.com/sport/cricket/kotian-caps-a-career-best-haul-to-set-up-mumbais-win/article71640337.ece","outlet":"The Hindu","title":"Kotian caps a career-best haul to set up Mumbai’s win","perspective":"–","read":true,"readable":true}],"other_coverage":[{"text":"The article was published on October 30, 2026 at 03:20 am IST.","ids":[81193],"class":"single","sources":[3]},{"text":"This victory was Mumbai's third consecutive Ranji Trophy win with a bonus point.","ids":[81164],"class":"single","sources":[1,3]},{"text":"Mumbai scored 430 runs in the first innings.","ids":[81184],"class":"single","sources":[3]},{"text":"Haryana scored 270 runs in the first innings.","ids":[81185],"class":"disputed","sources":[3]},{"text":"Musheer Khan was named Player of the Match.","ids":[81189],"class":"single","sources":[3]},{"text":"The fall of wickets for the match was 1-20, 2-54, 3-75, 4-117, 5-128, 6-165, 7-167, 8-248, 9-248.","ids":[81190],"class":"single","sources":[3]},{"text":"MUMBAI bowling figures were: Mulani 16-6-49-0, Kotian 34.3-7-81-8, Avasthi 3-1-11-0, D’Souza 3-0-8-0, Musheer 22-4-75-2, Deshpande 7-1-21-0.","ids":[81191],"class":"single","sources":[3]},{"text":"HARYANA bowling figures were: Chouhan 4.4-1-0-30-0, Sindhu 5-0-53-0, Vats 1-0-14-0.","ids":[81192],"class":"single","sources":[3]}]},"timeline":[],"undated":[],"established":[],"contested":[{"text":"Samant Jakhar and Anuj Thakral resisted for nearly two hours.","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":1,"sources":[{"outlet":"The Hindu","url":"https://www.thehindu.com/sport/cricket/ranji-trophy-kotian-fashions-mumbais-thumping-win-with-career-best-figures/article71640656.ece","stance":"asserts"},{"outlet":"The Hindu","url":"https://www.thehindu.com/sport/cricket/kotian-caps-a-career-best-haul-to-set-up-mumbais-win/article71640337.ece","stance":"asserts"}]},{"text":"Tanush Kotian registered his career-best figures in an innings and a match.","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":1,"sources":[{"outlet":"The Hindu","url":"https://www.thehindu.com/sport/cricket/ranji-trophy-kotian-fashions-mumbais-thumping-win-with-career-best-figures/article71640656.ece","stance":"asserts"},{"outlet":"The Hindu","url":"https://www.thehindu.com/sport/cricket/kotian-caps-a-career-best-haul-to-set-up-mumbais-win/article71640337.ece","stance":"asserts"}]},{"text":"Mumbai openers ensured there was no late drama.","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":1,"sources":[{"outlet":"The Hindu","url":"https://www.thehindu.com/sport/cricket/ranji-trophy-kotian-fashions-mumbais-thumping-win-with-career-best-figures/article71640656.ece","stance":"asserts"},{"outlet":"The Hindu","url":"https://www.thehindu.com/sport/cricket/kotian-caps-a-career-best-haul-to-set-up-mumbais-win/article71640337.ece","stance":"asserts"}]},{"text":"Tanush Kotian claimed eight wickets for 81 runs in the second innings against Haryana.","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":1,"sources":[{"outlet":"The Hindu","url":"https://www.thehindu.com/sport/cricket/ranji-trophy-kotian-fashions-mumbais-thumping-win-with-career-best-figures/article71640656.ece","stance":"asserts"}]},{"text":"Haryana was bowled out for 256 runs in their second innings.","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":1,"sources":[{"outlet":"The Hindu","url":"https://www.thehindu.com/sport/cricket/ranji-trophy-kotian-fashions-mumbais-thumping-win-with-career-best-figures/article71640656.ece","stance":"asserts"}]},{"text":"Mumbai openers Divyaansh Saxena and Angkrish Raghuvanshi chased the 97-run target in less than 11 overs.","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":1,"sources":[{"outlet":"The Hindu","url":"https://www.thehindu.com/sport/cricket/ranji-trophy-kotian-fashions-mumbais-thumping-win-with-career-best-figures/article71640656.ece","stance":"asserts"},{"outlet":"The Hindu","url":"https://www.thehindu.com/sport/cricket/kotian-caps-a-career-best-haul-to-set-up-mumbais-win/article71640337.ece","stance":"asserts"}]},{"text":"Tanush Kotian opened the bowling for Mumbai from the pavilion end.","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":1,"sources":[{"outlet":"The Hindu","url":"https://www.thehindu.com/sport/cricket/ranji-trophy-kotian-fashions-mumbais-thumping-win-with-career-best-figures/article71640656.ece","stance":"asserts"}]},{"text":"Tanush Kotian induced an edge from Yashvardhan Dalal which Sarfaraz Khan caught.","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":1,"sources":[{"outlet":"The Hindu","url":"https://www.thehindu.com/sport/cricket/ranji-trophy-kotian-fashions-mumbais-thumping-win-with-career-best-figures/article71640656.ece","stance":"asserts"},{"outlet":"The Hindu","url":"https://www.thehindu.com/sport/cricket/kotian-caps-a-career-best-haul-to-set-up-mumbais-win/article71640337.ece","stance":"asserts"}]},{"text":"Himanshu Rana returned to bat after retiring hurt.","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":1,"sources":[{"outlet":"The Hindu","url":"https://www.thehindu.com/sport/cricket/ranji-trophy-kotian-fashions-mumbais-thumping-win-with-career-best-figures/article71640656.ece","stance":"asserts"}]},{"text":"Akash Anand caught Nishant Sindhu off Tanush Kotian's bowling.","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":1,"sources":[{"outlet":"The Hindu","url":"https://www.thehindu.com/sport/cricket/ranji-trophy-kotian-fashions-mumbais-thumping-win-with-career-best-figures/article71640656.ece","stance":"asserts"}]},{"text":"Mumbai needed eight wickets to bowl out Haryana.","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":1,"sources":[{"outlet":"The Hindu","url":"https://www.thehindu.com/sport/cricket/ranji-trophy-kotian-fashions-mumbais-thumping-win-with-career-best-figures/article71640656.ece","stance":"asserts"}]},{"text":"Tanush Kotian claimed eight wickets for 84 runs to finish with a match haul of 11 wickets against Haryana.","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":1,"sources":[{"outlet":"The Hindu","url":"https://www.thehindu.com/sport/cricket/kotian-caps-a-career-best-haul-to-set-up-mumbais-win/article71640337.ece","stance":"asserts"},{"outlet":"The Hindu","url":"https://www.thehindu.com/sport/cricket/ranji-trophy-kotian-fashions-mumbais-thumping-win-with-career-best-figures/article71640656.ece","stance":"asserts"}]},{"text":"Haryana was bowled out for 256 runs at the stroke of tea.","verdict":"disputed","n_sources":1,"sources":[{"outlet":"The Hindu","url":"https://www.thehindu.com/sport/cricket/kotian-caps-a-career-best-haul-to-set-up-mumbais-win/article71640337.ece","stance":"asserts"}]},{"text":"Himanshu Rana returned to join Nishant Sindhu after retiring hurt the previous evening.","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":1,"sources":[{"outlet":"The Hindu","url":"https://www.thehindu.com/sport/cricket/kotian-caps-a-career-best-haul-to-set-up-mumbais-win/article71640337.ece","stance":"asserts"}]},{"text":"Tanush Kotian got one to turn sharply into Himanshu Rana, whose edge was held by Divyaansh Saxena at leg-slip.","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":1,"sources":[{"outlet":"The Hindu","url":"https://www.thehindu.com/sport/cricket/kotian-caps-a-career-best-haul-to-set-up-mumbais-win/article71640337.ece","stance":"asserts"},{"outlet":"The Hindu","url":"https://www.thehindu.com/sport/cricket/ranji-trophy-kotian-fashions-mumbais-thumping-win-with-career-best-figures/article71640656.ece","stance":"asserts"}]},{"text":"Nishant Sindhu fell at the stroke of lunch by inside-edging a sweep caught by Akash Anand.","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":1,"sources":[{"outlet":"The Hindu","url":"https://www.thehindu.com/sport/cricket/kotian-caps-a-career-best-haul-to-set-up-mumbais-win/article71640337.ece","stance":"asserts"}]},{"text":"Tanush Kotian turned the ball through Anuj Thakral's defence to hit the stumps.","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":1,"sources":[{"outlet":"The Hindu","url":"https://www.thehindu.com/sport/cricket/kotian-caps-a-career-best-haul-to-set-up-mumbais-win/article71640337.ece","stance":"asserts"},{"outlet":"The Hindu","url":"https://www.thehindu.com/sport/cricket/ranji-trophy-kotian-fashions-mumbais-thumping-win-with-career-best-figures/article71640656.ece","stance":"asserts"}]},{"text":"Angkrish Raghuvanshi sealed the win with a swat over midwicket for six off Kanishk Chouhan.","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":1,"sources":[{"outlet":"The Hindu","url":"https://www.thehindu.com/sport/cricket/kotian-caps-a-career-best-haul-to-set-up-mumbais-win/article71640337.ece","stance":"asserts"},{"outlet":"The Hindu","url":"https://www.thehindu.com/sport/cricket/ranji-trophy-kotian-fashions-mumbais-thumping-win-with-career-best-figures/article71640656.ece","stance":"asserts"}]},{"text":"Mumbai's openers cleared the boundary with ease against Haryana's spinners.","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":1,"sources":[{"outlet":"The Hindu","url":"https://www.thehindu.com/sport/cricket/kotian-caps-a-career-best-haul-to-set-up-mumbais-win/article71640337.ece","stance":"asserts"}]},{"text":"Divyaansh Saxena scored 30 not out from 25 balls with two fours and two sixes.","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":1,"sources":[{"outlet":"The Hindu","url":"https://www.thehindu.com/sport/cricket/kotian-caps-a-career-best-haul-to-set-up-mumbais-win/article71640337.ece","stance":"asserts"}]},{"text":"Angkrish Raghuvanshi scored 67 not out from 39 balls with seven fours and three sixes.","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":1,"sources":[{"outlet":"The Hindu","url":"https://www.thehindu.com/sport/cricket/kotian-caps-a-career-best-haul-to-set-up-mumbais-win/article71640337.ece","stance":"asserts"}]},{"text":"Mumbai needed eight wickets to seal victory while Haryana needed to bat out to salvage a draw.","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":1,"sources":[{"outlet":"The Hindu","url":"https://www.thehindu.com/sport/cricket/kotian-caps-a-career-best-haul-to-set-up-mumbais-win/article71640337.ece","stance":"asserts"}]},{"text":"Haryana scored 256 runs in 85.3 overs in the second innings.","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":1,"sources":[{"outlet":"The Hindu","url":"https://www.thehindu.com/sport/cricket/kotian-caps-a-career-best-haul-to-set-up-mumbais-win/article71640337.ece","stance":"asserts"},{"outlet":"The Hindu","url":"https://www.thehindu.com/sport/cricket/ranji-trophy-kotian-fashions-mumbais-thumping-win-with-career-best-figures/article71640656.ece","stance":"asserts"}]},{"text":"Mumbai scored 97 runs for no loss in 10.4 overs in the second innings.","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":1,"sources":[{"outlet":"The Hindu","url":"https://www.thehindu.com/sport/cricket/kotian-caps-a-career-best-haul-to-set-up-mumbais-win/article71640337.ece","stance":"asserts"},{"outlet":"The Hindu","url":"https://www.thehindu.com/sport/cricket/ranji-trophy-kotian-fashions-mumbais-thumping-win-with-career-best-figures/article71640656.ece","stance":"asserts"}]},{"text":"Mumbai won the match by 10 wickets.","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":1,"sources":[{"outlet":"The Hindu","url":"https://www.thehindu.com/sport/cricket/kotian-caps-a-career-best-haul-to-set-up-mumbais-win/article71640337.ece","stance":"asserts"}]},{"text":"Haryana was bowled out for 256 runs in their second innings, and after that Mumbai openers Divyaansh Saxena and Angkrish Raghuvanshi chased the 97-run target in less than 11 overs.","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":1,"sources":[{"outlet":"The Hindu","url":"https://www.thehindu.com/sport/cricket/ranji-trophy-kotian-fashions-mumbais-thumping-win-with-career-best-figures/article71640656.ece","stance":"asserts"}]},{"text":"Haryana was bowled out for 256 runs at the stroke of tea, and after that Divyaansh Saxena and Angkrish Raghuvanshi overhauled the 97-run target in less than 11 overs.","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":1,"sources":[{"outlet":"The Hindu","url":"https://www.thehindu.com/sport/cricket/kotian-caps-a-career-best-haul-to-set-up-mumbais-win/article71640337.ece","stance":"asserts"}]}],"context":[]},"payload_hi":{"story_id":51610,"headline":"मुंबई के ओपनर्स ने हरियाणा को हराने के लिए 11 ओवर में 97 रन के लक्ष्य का पीछा किया","counts":{"articles":2,"independent_sources":1,"outlets":1},"has_established":false,"qualified_by":"express","perspective_mode":"none","perspectives":{"–":["The Hindu"]},"framing":[],"suicide":false,"thread":24335,"parents":[{"story_id":24335,"headline":"वानखेड़े में मुंबई ने चंडीगढ़ को एक पारी और 155 रन से हराया"},{"story_id":25963,"headline":"बंगाल ने रणजी ट्रॉफी मैच में दिल्ली को नौ विकेट से हराया"},{"story_id":46274,"headline":"मुंबई के ओपनर अंगकृष रघुवंशी ने रणजी ट्रॉफी में हरियाणा के खिलाफ 114 रन बनाए"}],"children":[],"written_at":"2026-10-30T20:23:21","category":{"v":2,"primary":["india"],"secondary":["life"],"tertiary":["sport-films"]},"places":["maharashtra","haryana"],"people":["Angkrish Raghuvanshi","Divyaansh Saxena","Nishant Sindhu","Samant Jakhar","Tanush Kotian","Akash Anand","Anuj Thakral","Kanishk Chouhan"],"narrative":{"paragraphs":[[{"text":"In the morning, Tanush Kotian opened the bowling (Ranji Trophy) for Mumbai from the pavilion end.","ids":[81156],"class":"single","sources":[1]}],[{"text":"सोमवार को, अंगकृष रघुवंशी और मुशीर खान ने हरियाणा के खिलाफ रणजी ट्रॉफी मुकाबले के शुरुआती दिन मुंबई को दबदबा बनाने में मदद की, जिसके दौरान चाय से ठीक पहले रघुवंशी सामंत जाखड़ की गेंद पर विकेट के पीछे कैच आउट हो गए।","ids":[-71725,-71729],"class":"single","sources":[2]},{"text":"दिव्यांश सक्सेना ने मुंबई की पहली पारी में 10 रन बनाए।","ids":[-71739],"class":"single","sources":[2]},{"text":"हरियाणा के गेंदबाजी आंकड़े इस प्रकार थे: अमन 14-6-40-1, अजित 15-1-44-0, अनुज थकराल 13-1-55-1, निशान्त सिंधु 9-0-51-0, जाखड़ 8-1-25-1, कनिष्क चौहान 20-1-59-0, वत्स 3-0-11-0।","ids":[-71745],"class":"single","sources":[2]}],[{"text":"हिमांशु राणा पिछली शाम रिटायर हर्ट होने के बाद बल्लेबाजी करने लौटे।","ids":[81158,81174],"class":"single","sources":[1,3]},{"text":"ब्रेक से पहले, आकाश आनंद ने कोटियान की गेंदबाजी पर सिंधु का कैच लपका।","ids":[81160],"class":"single","sources":[1]},{"text":"सिंधु लंच के समय स्वीप शॉट पर अंदरूनी किनारा लगने से आनंद द्वारा लपके गए।","ids":[81176],"class":"single","sources":[3]}],[{"text":"गुरुवार को, कोटियान ने हरियाणा के खिलाफ दूसरी पारी में 81 रन देकर आठ विकेट लिए।","ids":[81153],"class":"single","sources":[1]},{"text":"मुंबई के ओपनर सक्सेना और रघुवंशी ने 11 ओवर से कम में 97 रन का लक्ष्य हासिल कर लिया, जिसमें रघुवंशी ने कनिष्क चौहान की गेंद पर मिडविकेट के ऊपर छक्का लगाकर जीत दिलाई।","ids":[81155,81178],"class":"single","sources":[1,3]},{"text":"जाखड़ और थकराल ने प्रतिरोध किया जो लगभग दो घंटे तक चला।","ids":[81166],"class":"single","sources":[1,3]}],[{"text":"सक्सेना ने दो चौकों और दो छक्कों की मदद से 25 गेंदों में 30 रन नाबाद बनाए।","ids":[81181],"class":"single","sources":[3]},{"text":"रघुवंशी ने सात चौकों और तीन छक्कों की मदद से 39 गेंदों में 67 रन नाबाद बनाए।","ids":[81182],"class":"single","sources":[3]}],[{"text":"मुंबई को हरियाणा को आउट करने और जीत पक्की करने के लिए आठ विकेट की जरूरत थी, जबकि हरियाणा को ड्रॉ बचाने के लिए बल्लेबाजी करनी थी।","ids":[81165,81183],"class":"single","sources":[1,3]},{"text":"हरियाणा ने दूसरी पारी में 85.3 ओवर में 256 रन बनाए।","ids":[81186],"class":"single","sources":[1,3]},{"text":"मुंबई ने दूसरी पारी में 10.4 ओवर में बिना किसी नुकसान के 97 रन बनाए और 10 विकेट से मैच जीत लिया।","ids":[81187,81188],"class":"single","sources":[1,3]}]],"section_keys":["news","background","happened","performers","performers","numbers"],"sources":[{"n":1,"url":"https://www.thehindu.com/sport/cricket/ranji-trophy-kotian-fashions-mumbais-thumping-win-with-career-best-figures/article71640656.ece","outlet":"The Hindu","title":"Ranji Trophy: Kotian’s career-best show fashions Mumbai’s thumping win","perspective":"–","read":true,"readable":true},{"n":2,"url":"https://www.thehindu.com/sport/cricket/ranji-trophy-raghuvanshi-musheer-help-mumbai-take-opening-days-honours/article71626894.ece","outlet":"","title":"","perspective":"–","read":true